{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Jigsaw Drift 是結合拼圖、卡牌配對與空間管理的益智遊戲，適合喜歡動腦解謎、休閒挑戰及離線遊玩的玩家。原價 US $6.99，目前終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-190.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>配對消除與落塊機制</h2>\n<p>玩家需把拼圖塊放入合適位置，連接同組相鄰拼圖塊，完成區塊後將其消除，讓上方拼圖塊掉落並重塑盤面。每次放置都可能引發連鎖反應，亦可運用提示、洗牌與強力配對等輔助道具扭轉局面。遊戲考驗空間規劃與先後次序，離線亦可遊玩。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-183-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-184-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-185-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-186-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-187-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-188-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Jigsaw Drift -Card Drop Puzzle 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Jigsaw Drift -Card Drop Puzzle</li><li>應用類別：Games</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/jigsaw-drift-card-drop-puzzle/id6815909446\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:39:32.643326+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":390,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:26:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:19:59.106831+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:32:58.703516+00:00","content_hash":"efc7d2ff856470d7344237631c313c034c4b78b612950a55cfabe79792cd23ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}